{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満員電車です(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正確に言うと\n満員電車から満員電車に乗りかえます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて\n4th全握発表されたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/24\n京都パルスプラザ大展示場"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/5\n幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都はイブだね(・∀・)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の1/5はお正月イベントだったっけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末年始みなさんに会えるの楽しみにしてます＼^^／\n一緒に年あけよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親に服買ってもらってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n親と一緒に買いに行ったら\n買ってもらうときもあるよ〜\nけど自分で買うことのが多い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂で男装させたら誰が似合うと思う？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nなーちゃんと若月はコンベンションのときに\nイケメンになってたし\n生駒ちゃんはすでにイケメンだし\nその3人は絶対似合う！\nまあやも個人PVでやってたけど良かったよね！\nあとはえりか様に期待してる(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、\n京都ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、4th個別も全握も\n中田はいないけど今日の佛教大も\n京都になかなか縁があるよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで京都のオヌヌメ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『白竹堂』っていう扇子屋さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら行ってみてね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/0785368/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この扇子いただいたんだけど\n毎日持ち歩いてる(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのときの汗がやばいから必需品(*゜ロ゜)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}